"- Sylvain LE GAL (https://twitter.com/legalsylvain)\n"
"- Iván Todorovich <ivan.todorovich@gmail.com>\n"
"- `Tecnativa <https://www.tecnativa.com>`__\n"
"\n"
"  - Jairo Llopis\n"
"  - Víctor Martínez\n"
"\n"
"- Tatiana Deribina <tatiana.deribina@spritnit.fi>\n"
"- Tris Doan <tridm@trobz.com>\n"
"\n"
"Other credits\n"
"-------------\n"
"\n"
