"    :alt: OCA/queue\n"
".. |badge4| image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/weblate-Translate%20me-F47D42.png\n"
"    :target: https://translation.odoo-community.org/projects/queue-18-0/queue-18-0-queue_job_cron\n"
