"\n"
"This module allows you to sell recurring field services.\n"
"\n"
"**Table of contents**\n"
"\n"
".. contents::\n"
"   :local:\n"
"\n"
"Configuration\n"
"=============\n"
"\n"
"To setup a product for quoting and selling field service orders:\n"
"\n"
"-  Go to Sales > Catalog > Products\n"
"\n"
